		{
			dependencies: ["189F03AC93B421FF"]
			description: [
				"Avaritia's gear ignores the rules: a sword that kills anything, armour nothing gets through, tools that dig a mountain at a time."
				""
				"The road is long on purpose. Neutronium trickles out of a collector for hours; singularities eat thousands of ingots each; the &eInfinity Catalyst&f at the end needs all of them, and in Eldermoor it also needs a trophy from every boss of &6World Eater&f (Act IV):"
				""
				"&7- the Harbinger of Moonlight's, the Day Stalker's, the Night Prowler's and the Monarch of Chaos's Lord Souls"
				"&7- Malkuth's, Chesed's and Geburah's trophies"
				"&7- the Ender Keeper's Void Echo"
				"&7- a Broken Halo (made by sacrificing an Apostle, see the Goety chapter)"
				"&7- the Warden's Heart of the Deep"
				"&7- a Chaos Shard from the Chaos Guardian's island"
				""
				"Start the collectors now. The Catalyst waits for World Eater."
			]
